%% Agent run lifecycle — the states streamed live to the dashboard.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending
    pending --> planning: dispatch to worker
    planning --> acting: plan produced
    acting --> observing: tool result (via tool proxy)
    acting --> succeeded: final answer (no tool needed)
    observing --> observing: further steps (more tools)
    observing --> succeeded: final answer
    planning --> failed: error
    acting --> failed: tool denied / error
    observing --> failed: tool denied / error
    succeeded --> [*]
    failed --> [*]

    note right of acting
        Every tool call is validated by the
        tool proxy before it runs, and audited.
    end note
